    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like i literally don't even exist anymore. like i woke up today and everyone i knew just... stopped. no one's texting, no one's posting, it's like they all just collectively decided i never happened. it's so quiet. i feel like a ghost just walking around a room.",
