      "content": "I sincerely wish you could feel safety without having to fight it, but thoughts of ending your existence are incredibly heavy and dangerous things to entertain alone. Please know that leaning into nothingness is not actually easier than enduring the pain of withdrawal or isolation right now, because there is a person who cares enough to offer support if you are willing to listen. You are not defined by the emptiness you feel; reaching out even while it hurts is the only path toward finding the grounding you need.",
